{"title":"Career Roadmap · Sports Physiotherapist","role":"Sports Physiotherapist","summary":"A Sports Physiotherapist specializes in the prevention, assessment, rehabilitation and functional recovery of sports-related injuries and movement problems.","facts":{"Current degree":"Allied Health Sciences (B.Sc / BPT / BOT / BMLT etc.)","Course":"Physiotherapy - Sports / Neuro / Paediatric Rehabilitation"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Sports Physiotherapist specializes in the prevention, assessment, rehabilitation and functional recovery of sports-related injuries and movement problems."},{"type":"p","text":"The career combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Musculoskeletal assessment"},{"text":"Exercise therapy"},{"text":"Injury rehabilitation"},{"text":"Sports injury prevention"},{"text":"Strength and conditioning principles"},{"text":"Return-to-sport planning"},{"text":"Functional movement assessment"},{"text":"Athlete education"},{"text":"Recovery management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical environments include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sports academies"},{"text":"Professional sports teams"},{"text":"Fitness and performance centres"},{"text":"Sports medicine clinics"},{"text":"Hospitals"},{"text":"Rehabilitation centres"},{"text":"Universities and colleges"},{"text":"Athletic training facilities"},{"text":"Professional and amateur sporting organizations"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Qualification note","text":"In India, physiotherapy is a regulated healthcare profession with qualification and registration requirements that can vary according to the applicable national/state framework. A student targeting this career should complete the recognized physiotherapy qualification required for professional practice, rather than assuming that any generic allied-health B.Sc qualifies them to practice independently as a physiotherapist."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","ki